Hook fixtures for the V18 self-test (team/03 section 4.2). Each .json file here is one
fixture: the handler its cases run against, a preset and the cases. A file's name says
what its cases cover and need not be its handler's.
Generated by `cargo xtask kit render` from .agents/kit/hooks.toml; do not edit.

The registered handlers:
