model-gate  UserPromptSubmit (all), timeout 10 s, blocks when it fails
model-switch  PreModelSwitch (all), timeout 10 s, blocks when it fails
guard-path  PreToolUse Edit|Write|MultiEdit|NotebookEdit, timeout 10 s, blocks when it fails
guard-command  PreToolUse Bash|PowerShell, timeout 10 s, blocks when it fails
post-edit  PostToolUse Edit|Write|MultiEdit|NotebookEdit, timeout 60 s, Claude Code's default when it fails
post-bash  PostToolUse Bash|PowerShell, timeout 20 s, Claude Code's default when it fails
subagent-start  SubagentStart (all), timeout 20 s, Claude Code's default when it fails
subagent-stop  SubagentStop (all), timeout 60 s, Claude Code's default when it fails
stop-gate  Stop (all), timeout 600 s, Claude Code's default when it fails
stop-failure  StopFailure (all), timeout 10 s, Claude Code's default when it fails
pre-compact  PreCompact (all), timeout 60 s, Claude Code's default when it fails
config-change  ConfigChange (all), timeout 10 s, blocks when it fails
